OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA little light and patchy rain
OL,6,Fspreading southeast this morning. Then
OL,7,Fthis afternoon will become dry with
OL,8,Fcloud breaking to give some good
OL,9,Fspells of sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with
OL,12,Fclear periods. Then the rest of the
OL,13,Fnight will remain dry but some high
OL,14,Fcloud spreading from the west. Chilly.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FMainly dry with some bright
OL,17,For sunny spells. A few light showers
OL,18,Facross western Tayside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
