OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FShowers in the west on Wednesday
OL,7,Fmorning will spread across the east in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Dry and bright on
OL,9,FThursday, rain by evening. Early rain
OL,10,Fon Friday then dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
